{"id":"4127f3d29caceee5","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-prop-finite-intersection.md","title":"Finite Intersection Property","display":"prop-finite-intersection — Finite Intersection Property","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-finite-intersection","aliases":["58-prop-finite-intersection"],"display":"prop-finite-intersection — Finite Intersection Property","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-intersection.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-finite-intersection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-finite-intersection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-finite-intersection — Finite Intersection Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fde8356a8733e94f\" href=\"?note=fde8356a8733e94f\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-intersection.md\">../batch06/58-df-intersection.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,X,A,B\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F,X,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\)</span> (order-filter predicate from dependency)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\{\\langle U,W\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X):U\\subseteq W\\})\n\\land A\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land B\\in\\mathcal F\n\\to A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\{\\langle U,W\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X):U\\subseteq W\\})\n\\land A\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land B\\in\\mathcal F\n\\to A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A filter on the inclusion poset <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> is closed under finite intersections.</li>\n<li>This property characterizes filterbases and extends to ultrafilter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-intersection.md","status":"resolved","id":"fde8356a8733e94f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-intersection.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F,X,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\{\\langle U,W\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X):U\\subseteq W\\})\n\\land A\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land B\\in\\mathcal F\n\\to A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal F","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":899,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3958","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-prop-finite-intersection.md|58-prop-finite-in